# Reflected light (GI): the acceptance clips of step 2 of the ray-tracing revisit
# (reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/README.md): the user judges «без GI | GI» by eye. Clips only, no
# shots. The places and camera set-ups of gi-clips.bench; each clip is a slow turn of the held camera (1 s still,
# 9 s turn, 1 s still), the last one a walk down the harbour street (route: the hero is placed on the path every
# fixed step, so both runs move the same; he and the npcs are hidden, he would slide without steps). A turn before
# a clip (`cloth camera-turn <deg> 1`) sets the first view; 10 s after it light the probes before `rec`.
# Run it once per variant, the same window, and put the halves side by side:
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=0                  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-accept
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-accept
# @timeout 1500
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off

# 1. The candle- and torch-lit harbour house of perf-interior at 22:00: from the cabinet on the right past the candle
#    and the lit wall to the shelves in the dark corner on the left.
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 160 170 180
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn -20 1
wait 10000
rec interior-night
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn 90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 2. The plank hut of the harbour's poor quarter at noon: from the sunlit wall on the left to the dark corner and the
#    window on the right.
set time 12 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_HUT_01_IN
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 180 170 0
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 30 1
wait 10000
rec hut-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 3. A street of the harbour's poor quarter at midnight: the lamp post and the lit house on the left, then the street
#    to the right.
set time 0 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_06
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 500 200 270
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 30 1
wait 10000
rec harbour-night
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 4. The same street at midnight, walked: the camera follows 5 m behind the hero from PATH_04 to PATH_06 (10.5 m at
#    1.2 m/s, past the lamp posts; further on the camera passes through a beam). Probes are placed by the distance
#    to the camera: light popping in shows here. `route` lifts the hero 50 cm from the ground to the waypoint on its
#    first step, so the camera jumps at 1.0 s: the side-by-side starts at frame 31.
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_04
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 500 200 180
view hide animated morph
wait 10000
rec harbour-night-walk
wait 1000
route 120 NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_04 NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_05 NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_06
wait 1000
stop
view full

# 5. The forest at noon under the crowns: from the rock on the left across the sunlit valley to the slope in the shade
#    on the right.
set time 12 0
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_66
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 130
cam world 400 140 180
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 30 1
wait 10000
rec forest-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 6. The bandit cave by Lobart's farm at noon: from the mouth with daylight on the left to the fire on the right.
goto NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_02
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 350 180 0
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 20 1
wait 10000
rec cave-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -100 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 7. The same cave at 23:00: the dark mouth, then the fire.
set time 23 0
cam world 350 180 0
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 20 1
wait 10000
rec cave-night
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -100 9000
wait 1000
stop
